UPDATE figurines SET visual_caption = $cap$Quasimodo, a hunched man with a wrinkled, sad face, pale blue eyes and tousled reddish-brown hair, sits bent forward with his head bowed. He wears a loose beige-brown hooded tunic tied with a rope belt, striped dark trousers and has bare feet; around his neck hang a long bronze chain and old keys, and he holds the chain in one hand. He sits on a large pale seashell or on a small dark stool in front of a dark grey marbled wall and a floor of old bricks. The mood is melancholic, gloomy and gothic.
