UPDATE figurines SET visual_caption = $cap$A small Black village woman with dark skin and a warm, gentle smile stands barefoot on a wooden floor, holding a woven wicker basket filled with dried vegetables or herbs. She wears a colourful red, orange and white patterned headwrap, a long beige dress with small white dots and a fringed overlayer, a long necklace of red, white and brown beads, bead bracelets and a red-white anklet. In some photos a hand holds her to show her size and the basket stands on the floor beside her; behind her is a pale wood-effect wallpaper with white plants. The mood is warm, cheerful and rustic.
