UPDATE figurines SET visual_caption = $cap$A little gnome cook with curly tousled light-brown hair, pointed ears, a long nose and blue eyes dances on one leg holding a metal ladle. He wears a tall pointed black cap, a lime-green shirt with white dots and puffed sleeves, black overalls with red suspenders and big buttons, red-and-white striped stockings, black shoes tied with white bows and a short olive green cape of rough netting. Next to him stand a miniature brick stove with an orange flame and a small black cooking pot of soup, on a wooden floor in front of a pale wall with white plants. In several photos a hand holds him by the fingers. The mood is playful, funny and cozy.
