UPDATE figurines SET visual_caption = $cap$A Native American man with a lined, dignified face, dark skin and two long black braids stands calmly holding a small grey-blue falcon on his outstretched hand. He wears a tall round headdress of golden straw with a red-and-yellow band, a red-and-white geometric woven poncho with a fringed edge over a white fringed tunic, black quilted trousers and tan fur leg warmers with pointed brown shoes. Small feathers hang at his sides. The photos show him on a wooden floor in front of a pale wood-effect wallpaper with white plants, and in some a hand holds him to show his size. The mood is calm, dignified and rustic.
