UPDATE figurines SET visual_caption = $cap$A cheerful old forester with a bald head, tufts of grey hair, a grey beard and big pale eyes carries a small red squirrel on his open palm while a second red squirrel sits on top of his head. He wears a loose beige tunic with small white dots tied with a red-and-white rope with a bundle of pine cones tucked in, a black-grey knitted collar over his shoulders and furry round shoes. In some photos a hand holds him to show his size, in front of a pale wood-effect wallpaper with white plants and a dark table. The mood is friendly, funny and cozy.
