UPDATE figurines SET visual_caption = $cap$A grumpy old gnome with a long grey beard, wild grey-brown hair, pointed ears, a long sharp nose and a scowling face leans forward holding a small pickaxe. He wears a very tall bent dark green pointed cap, a rough olive-green netting cape over his shoulders, a red tunic with flared sleeves, black leggings with red cuffs and long black pointed shoes. The photos show him on a wooden floor in front of a pale wood-effect wallpaper with white plants. The mood is grumpy, sly and a little mysterious.
