UPDATE figurines SET visual_caption = $cap$An old wizard with a long grey beard, wild tousled white-grey hair and deep-set eyes stands leaning on a tall crooked branch staff, on top of which a black raven perches. He wears a tattered dark brown robe over a yellow-ochre front panel, a copper spiral belt buckle and a huge torn burlap cloak draped over his shoulders, and dark pointed shoes. The photos show a wall of old handwritten letters with botanical drawings and a pale wooden table. The mood is wise, mysterious and rustic.
